-- What the circulars that update the 2016 shekel supplement print in the same words (MMS-775):
-- each such declaration is declared here once and imported by every circular
-- that prints it. A circular cites the rows a declaration encodes in a note
-- where the declaration stood; above each one here is where it is printed.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT parties

-- circular תשע"ח/5, circular תשע"ט/3 and circular תש"ף/3
`the second group's members on the first parse` MEANS LIST "teachers not under Oz LaTmura", "every principal"

-- circular תשע"ח/5, circular תשע"ט/3 and circular תש"ף/3
`the second group's members on the second parse` MEANS LIST "teachers not under Oz LaTmura", "principals not under Oz LaTmura"

-- circular תשע"ח/5, circular תשע"ט/3 and circular תש"ף/3
`the two parses place a principal under Oz LaTmura differently` MEANS
    NOT (`the second group's members on the first parse` EQUALS `the second group's members on the second parse`)

-- circular תשע"ט/4 and circular תש"ף/4
`every grade checked` MEANS map (GIVEN k YIELD k DIVIDED BY 2) (range 0 10)

-- circular תש"ף/3 and circular תש"ף/4
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the shekel supplement 2016 is linked to the consumer price index` IS TRUE

-- circular תש"ף/3 and circular תש"ף/4
GIVEN x IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `or nothing` x IS
    CONSIDER x
    WHEN JUST a THEN a
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0

-- circular תשפ"ב/4 and circular תשפ"ב/5
GIVEN `amount set by the agreements` IS A NUMBER @desc the supplement as the collective agreements set it, before indexation
      `index of the update`          IS A NUMBER @desc the consumer price index the update is made to
      `index of the base`            IS A NUMBER @desc the consumer price index the agreements' amount stands at
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the supplement linked to the CPI` `amount set by the agreements` `index of the update` `index of the base` IS
    `amount set by the agreements` TIMES (`index of the update` DIVIDED BY `index of the base`)

-- circular תשפ"ג/6 and circular תשפ"ג/7
`February 2023` MEANS 2

-- circular תשפ"ד/5 and circular תשפ"ד/6
`January 2024`  MEANS 1

-- circular תשפ"ד/5 and circular תשפ"ד/6
`February 2024` MEANS 2

-- circular תשפ"ד/5 and circular תשפ"ד/6
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the re-indexed amounts apply on` `the day` IF
    `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 1 2024

-- circular תשפ"ד/5 and circular תשפ"ד/6
DECLARE `reimbursement` HAS
    `reimbursed to` IS A Party
    `through`       IS A STRING

-- circular תשפ"ד/5 and circular תשפ"ד/6
GIVEN `paid from month` IS A NUMBER @desc the month (from December 2023 = 0) whose salary first carries the updated amount
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the months of retroactive difference owed` `paid from month` IS
    max 0 (`paid from month` MINUS `January 2024`)

-- circular תשפ"ד/6, circular תשפ"ה/7 and circular תשפ"ו/6
`the grades checked` MEANS map (GIVEN k YIELD k DIVIDED BY 2) (range 2 19)

-- circular תשפ"ה/6 and circular תשפ"ה/7
GIVEN `index of December 2024` IS A NUMBER, `index of December 2023` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the linkage ratio` `index of December 2024` `index of December 2023` IS
    `index of December 2024` DIVIDED BY `index of December 2023`
